196	// reason other than "not installed" or "not indexed yet" used to be collapsed
197	// into the same bare nil semantic source as those two ordinary, silent cases.
198	// The error text must survive into the report instead -- for a plain command
199	// failure, AND for every live-path version mismatch introduced alongside this
